---
// TEMPLATE: needs review by a legal professional before launch.
// Bracketed items must be filled in.
import LegalPage from '../components/company/LegalPage.astro';
import { site, contact, href, contactHref } from '../data/site';

const sections = [
  { id: 'acceptance', title: 'Accepting these terms' },
  { id: 'about', title: 'About us' },
  { id: 'use', title: 'Using this website' },
  { id: 'information', title: 'Information on this site' },
  { id: 'enquiries', title: 'Enquiries, quotes and projects' },
  { id: 'ip', title: 'Intellectual property' },
  { id: 'links', title: 'Third-party links' },
  { id: 'disclaimer', title: 'Disclaimer' },
  { id: 'liability', title: 'Limitation of liability' },
  { id: 'privacy', title: 'Privacy' },
  { id: 'law', title: 'Governing law and disputes' },
  { id: 'changes', title: 'Changes to these terms' },
  { id: 'contact', title: 'Contact' },
];
---

<LegalPage
  title="Terms of use"
  description={`The terms that apply when you use the ${site.name} website.`}
  intro="The rules that apply when you use this website. Work we do for clients is governed by a separate written agreement, not by this page."
  updated="[DD Month YYYY]"
  sections={sections}
>
  <section id="acceptance">
    <h2>1. Accepting these terms</h2>
    <p>By using this website you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>2. About us</h2>
    <p>This website is operated by {site.name} (“Manka”, “we”, “us”), based in {site.location}.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="use">
    <h2>3. Using this website</h2>
    <p>You may use this website for lawful purposes only. You agree not to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>attempt to gain unauthorised access to the site, its servers or any connected systems;</li>
      <li>introduce malware, or interfere with the site’s normal operation;</li>
      <li>send spam, automated submissions or misleading information through our forms; or</li>
      <li>copy or scrape content from the site in bulk for commercial use without our written permission.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="information">
    <h2>4. Information on this site</h2>
    <p>
      Content on this website, including articles in our Insights section, is general information about our services and related topics. It is not legal, financial, tax or regulatory advice, and you should not rely on it as such. Lenders and other regulated businesses should confirm requirements with their own compliance and legal advisers.
    </p>
    <p>We try to keep content accurate and current, but we do not guarantee that it is complete or up to date.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="enquiries">
    <h2>5. Enquiries, quotes and projects</h2>
    <p>
      Sending an enquiry does not create a contract. Any estimate, proposal or price we share is indicative until both parties sign a written agreement or statement of work. That agreement, not these terms, governs scope, fees, timelines, ownership of deliverables, confidentiality and support.
    </p>
    <p>Descriptions of our products on this site may change as the products develop. The features available to you are those set out in your agreement or order.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="ip">
    <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      The Manka name, logo, website design, text and graphics are owned by or licensed to us. You may view and share links to pages and quote short extracts with attribution. Any other use requires our written permission.
    </p>
    <p>Product and company names belonging to others are used only to identify them and remain the property of their owners.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="links">
    <h2>7. Third-party links</h2>
    <p>This website may link to other websites. We do not control them and are not responsible for their content, privacy practices or availability.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="disclaimer">
    <h2>8. Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      This website is provided “as is” and “as available”. To the extent permitted by law, we make no warranties, express or implied, about the website, including that it will be uninterrupted, error-free or free of harmful components.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="liability">
    <h2>9. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any indirect, incidental or consequential loss, or any loss of data, profit or business, arising from your use of this website or reliance on its content. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited under applicable law. [Legal reviewer to confirm wording.]
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="privacy">
    <h2>10. Privacy</h2>
    <p>How we handle personal data is explained in our <a href={href('/privacy')}>privacy policy</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="law">
    <h2>11. Governing law and disputes</h2>
    <p>
      These terms are governed by the laws of India. The courts of India will have jurisdiction over any dispute arising from them. We encourage you to contact us first so we can try to resolve any concern informally.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="changes">
    <h2>12. Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The “Last updated” date shows the latest version. Continuing to use the site after a change means you accept the updated terms.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2>13. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms?{' '}
      {contact.email ? <>Email <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a></> : <>Write to us through the <a href={contactHref('other')}>contact form</a></>}
      {contact.phone ? <> or call {contact.phone}</> : null}.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
